   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Guys,<div>hope you all are doing good.</div><div>I am new to this group as well as to R and rstudio server.</div><div>I have installed r3.1..0 and rstudiio0.98.507. </div><div>when I am trying to plot a line in rstudio, I am getting the below error.</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:14px;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.253334045410156px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">y=seq(1.1000,10)\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">y\r\n</span>[1] 1.1 2.1 3.1 4.1 5.1 6.1 7.1 8.1 9.1\r\n<span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">plot(y)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in RStudioGD() : \r\n  Shadow graphics dev</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">ice error: r error 4 (R code execution error)</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:14px;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.253334045410156px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:14px;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.253334045410156px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:14px;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.253334045410156px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:14px;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.253334045410156px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Looking fro some help.pointer on this.</span></pre></div></div>"
    ]
